{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3bda5078-e24a-85e0-968d-f86e64b29c31",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T09:14:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:12:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:12:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Um, I need a new recycling bin? Mine is, ah, broken. Can I get a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can help with that. Is it cracked, or did it go missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The bottom is cracked. And the lid, it does not close. So the wind blows the paper out on the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that happens. What's the address where it's picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "458 Callender Avenue. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 458 Callender. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Declan Flynn. F-L-Y-N-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Flynn. So I can put in the request for you right now over the phone. They'll deliver a new one to the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I thought maybe I must go to City Hall and fill a form? Or I must pick it up myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no need to come in. I'll enter it from here. Just leave the old one out by the curb if you can, and they may take it when they drop off the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave the broken one? On the day of the trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:13:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not necessarily your trash day. Just put it at the curb and keep it empty, so they can see it. It'll take a little while, maybe a week or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. Okay. And then I do not need to call again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, you're all set once I put this in. If nothing shows up in two weeks, call us back and we'll check on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Sorry, one more thing. Is the bin the same size? The blue one, the big one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the standard city recycling bin, so it should be like the one you have now. If you need a different size, tell the driver or call us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I ask because I am training for a half marathon, in the spring. I run early in the morning, and I see bins and paper in the street. I do not like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with the training. We'll get you a lid that closes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So, curb, empty, and wait one or two weeks? Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Have a good day, Mr. Flynn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T09:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
